WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:07.520
Once upon a time lived
a beautiful girl named Cinderella.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:14.860
But she was abused every day by
her wicked stepmother and stepsisters.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.200
Cinderella, clean our room.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.620
That's right! Then you need to scrub the floors.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.250
I don't want to.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.880
Crawl on the floor and scrub it yourself.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.750
You want me to crawl on the floor?

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.380
I think I'm up for it.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.050
Sister, don't be ridiculous.

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:34.010
You don't understand, I just...

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:37.140
Good. This works out well for everyone, then.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.930
Cinderella, how can you
treat your sister that way?

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:43.730
Poor Cinderella is being abused!

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:45.060
The poor thing.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:50.650
Poor Cinderella picks up the bucket
and goes to leave the room.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.450
But she ends up tripping and dropping it.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.160
Oh no! Water torture!

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.660
Cinderella, this is wonderful...
I mean... horrific!

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.330
I'm sorry, sister.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:03.700
I'll use this to wipe you clean.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.410
I get the mop?

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:06.540
--Hey.
--Are you okay, sister?

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:06.960
--What?
--Are you okay, sister?

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:07.540
--What?
--Yes. Cinderella is just fine.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:08.880
--Is this how Cinderella goes?
--Yes. Cinderella is just fine.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.050
--Is this how Cinderella goes?
--Cinderella, I'm not talking to you.

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:13.050
--No.
--Oh, I see.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:14.970
"Wicked Stepmother, It's Your Cue!"

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:15.340
"Episode 12: The Show Begins! Showtime"

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:18.220
Are they going to be okay?

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:23.180
The leader of the Nazarick
Floor Guardians, Albedo, is there.

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:26.440
There's nothing to worry about!

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:28.230
Is she that strong?

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:29.440
Yes.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:35.280
She's among the strongest of Nazarick's members.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.740
I see!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:40.780
We call her the big-mouthed
gorilla for a reason.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:46.960
I have the feeling Shalltear is
talking smack about me somewhere!

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.330
Wow!

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:53.920
We'll be on our way, Cinderella!

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.170
I'm so jealous.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:57.130
How come I don't get to go?

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:58.880
Damn it! I bet you're jealous!

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:01.550
Sister, don't swear in the school play.

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:02.930
--So, where are we going again?

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:04.810
--You can do this!
--So, where are we going again?

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:07.480
Mother, we're on our way to the ball!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.520
--You can do this, Demiurge!
--That's right.

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.070
Hang in there, Albedo!

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.570
Emilia! Puck!

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:23.910
Prepare the ice magic!

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.700
--Right!
--Leave it to me!

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:28.290
Aqua, can you make lots of water?

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:31.000
What? I'm the Goddess of Water!

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.840
Of course I can! Of course I can!

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.460
It's like taking candy from a baby!

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:38.050
Yes! For a genius wizard like me,

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:41.220
taking you to the ball is like
taking candy from a baby!

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.930
Nobody actually says that.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.930
I bet the one who wrote
that part of the script is...

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.060
Emilia.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:48.600
Yup.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:53.020
Sacred Create Water!

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:56.480
Well?

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:57.940
I used my full power!

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.530
That was too much power, but thank you!

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:01.660
Emilia!

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:02.950
Right!

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:09.620
Puck!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.040
I'm on it, Lia!

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:19.840
Um, Megumin said I'm supposed to
say an incantation...

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.680
Lia, it's nice that you do what others tell you.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.930
But I think you're okay
ignoring Megumin right now.

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:27.180
Am I?

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.770
Yeah. Okay!

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.980
Steel turn to ash,

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.310
stone to dust,

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:33.150
as the black gathers and...

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:35.270
That incantation is way too long!

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:37.690
Who told her she could ad-lib?

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:41.030
If we told her to make it short,
she wouldn't do it anyway!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.610
That's right, Ains!

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.920
<i>Ora-ora-ora-ora-ora-ora</i>!

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:08.890
What happens if that comes over here?

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:11.430
The school festival will be over.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.430
I don't want that!

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:14.650
I want to see Master be the duckling!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.520
Then fight!

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.020
Who are you?

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.940
To fight. To struggle.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.610
Got it! Thanks!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.780
Wait, sis!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.580
Youth is a wonderful thing.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.710
Behold this awesome carriage!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:38.790
I'm shocked that a mere pumpkin
could turn into something so pathetic.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.250
Who are you calling pathetic?

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.510
A talking carriage!

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.340
Carriages don't talk!

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:46.930
You were made to carry things, not talk!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:48.680
That's really cruel!

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:54.310
It's a terrible foe, Death Knight!

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:57.480
We should go help!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.440
--Let's go.
--Stay here.

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:05.450
There's no place for us in this battle.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.360
Why?

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.740
Because...

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:10.950
This is a battle for maidens!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.500
I'm female.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:21.210
Cinderella, why are you here?

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.260
That's right. You don't belong...

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.630
This isn't even a conversation.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:26.260
--But her brutal mocking laughter

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.510
--Hang in there...
--But her brutal mocking laughter

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.010
--Hang in there, Demiurge!
--is making me...

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.350
--Hang in there, Demiurge!

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.850
Raphtalia, Filo!

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.480
I'm counting on you!

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:38.440
We'll help!

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.440
Thanks!

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:42.860
Attack from different angles
so it can't focus its attacks!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.230
Got it!

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:46.070
Okay!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.750
Wow.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.710
She turns into a really strong bird!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.880
Am I strong? Am I strong?

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.880
Yes! Very strong!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:15.310
Something wrong?

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:16.890
Nothing at all, I wonder.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:20.690
She thinks you're thinking
naughty thoughts about her.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.070
I am not!

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.900
He's right, actually.

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:27.070
No!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.950
What is that?

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:37.410
It didn't have those last time!

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:41.880
It's not the Destroyer you know anymore!

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:49.590
Missile Parry!

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:53.180
Followed by... Counter Arrow!

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.220
Thank you!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:00.600
I'm saving myself for the one I love...

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.230
I'm saving myself for the one I love...

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.150
Wonderful! That's wonderful!

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:12.990
Yes! For the man I love, Lord Ains,
I must annihilate the Destroyer!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.780
That is my own diligence!

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:17.660
Love!

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:22.170
And so the two of them fell in love.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.810
High-density magic signal
emanating from the target!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.350
Watch out!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:39.520
Defensive wall!

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.390
Walls of Jericho!

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.810
You're good, for a human!

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.570
I was trained in hell!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.610
But...

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.240
I have to go. Sorry.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.280
Wait!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.080
At least tell me your name.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.630
What is this?

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.050
Visha!

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:15.470
I'm at my limit!

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:17.390
I'll protect you!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.430
Like Naofumi does!

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.690
She's absorbing it?

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.570
That's an amazing power!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.280
Demihuman!

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.070
Raphtalia!

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:39.660
Aqua!

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:40.660
Right!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:44.750
You fit the glass slipper perfectly!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:48.630
You are the princess I've been looking for!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:57.140
You're going to pay for trying to
mess with our school festival, Destroyer!

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:00.310
Taste my wrath!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:04.730
My rage at not being able to
see Lord Ains' legendary performance!

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.690
My sadness at not being able to
eat more chocolate bananas!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.480
My disappointment at not being able to
have more fun at the festival!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:11.440
I'm disappointed!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.320
Disappointed!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.030
Disappointed!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:17.820
So, it's up to you now, Aqua!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.370
Leave it to me!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:25.410
And this is for everybody!

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:28.290
--<i>God Blow</i>!

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:30.340
--Please accept the love of me,
--<i>God Blow</i>!

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:32.960
--the prince.
--<i>God Blow</i>!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:35.840
--Yes, with pleasure.
--<i>God Blow</i>!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.060
So...

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:48.310
Nothing changed!

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:52.900
So, let's get back to class!

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.490
So nothing changed at all, huh?

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.030
That's not quite true.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.330
Everything changes.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:11.340
Only when you come together
can you have the future you want.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.960
Why are you being serious all of a sudden?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:17.930
As long as you have the will to change it,

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:21.470
you can change the future as much as you want!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.890
Ros-<i>chi</i>.

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.060
What...

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.390
...does...

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.890
...that...

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.390
...mean?

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:32.440
Open your books to page 334!

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:33.820
Hold it!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:52.190
"New Season Coming Soon"
